{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1389450/extras/e1e19dd7b59d40dc1406f2bbc126b888.avif?t=1665639629\" width=480 height=186 /></span><br>                                                                             <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1389450/extras/5c85947c0045e5134faf6958dbf211a8.avif?t=1665639629\" width=300 height=80 /></span><br>The Spirit is an Action Role-Playing game with elements of old school dungeon crawlers. <br><br>Our protagonist wakes up in a strange world looking for answers. He learns that he has died and returned to the realm as a spirit. The only way he can find his way back to the living is to find the Rift Keeper. He soon learns that the world is being overrun by creatures and demons entering through the Rift. The people of the realm need him, but so does his family.<br><br>One thing that I tried to focus on was to have NPC characters explain or tell little bits of the story. So, even though it is not necessary always for completing a level, the players might find it useful and hopefully interesting to chat to the NPC characters!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1389450/extras/4acbcea4d1614e11f7ab10f8cb88c288.avif?t=1665639629\" width=118 height=118 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1389450/extras/aa57a507918e41e083deeb1fc7c8f461.avif?t=1665639629\" width=118 height=118 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1389450/extras/863dfd66547664b547456b8f36c2cbd0.avif?t=1665639629\" width=118 height=118 /></span><br>Some NPC characters will be able to join you and help you fight your way through hoards of enemies. It will be your task to help heal them. Use TAB to check health and descriptions of enemies. The game features branching dialogue, so if an NPC offers to help you, it is possible to decline his offer.<br><br>                                                                            <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1389450/extras/6d87333400edd1b0b717537ddc667168.avif?t=1665639629\" width=300 height=80 /></span><br>Environments range from mystical forests, dark dungeons, villages, caves and citadels. The goal was to create &quot;pretty&quot;, yet dark and gloomy environments for players to explore. There is even a haunted cemetery with massive hoards of enemies to slash down.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1389450/extras/b6f442632ae44137b8a19e788903ec3c.avif?t=1665639629\" width=488 height=108 /></span><br><br>                                                                            <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1389450/extras/ef43770682ada35ae7b20511e6f4588d.avif?t=1665639629\" width=300 height=80 /></span><br>There are many items in the game that players can collect in various ways. Find useful items in loot chests or crates throughout the levels. Players can also buy from items from merchants. Some items can be used as powerups when equipped in the character inventory. There are also many weapons to find in the game, however, the player can only have 1 weapon at a time. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1389450/extras/22_-_Stone2.PNG?t=1665639629\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1389450/extras/21_-_Stone.PNG?t=1665639629\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1389450/extras/11_-_Book.PNG?t=1665639629\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1389450/extras/09_-_Scroll.PNG?t=1665639629\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1389450/extras/08_-_herb_berry.PNG?t=1665639629\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1389450/extras/07_-_wild_flower.PNG?t=1665639629\" /></span><br><br>                                                                            <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1389450/extras/d07585383091190b7781f4d60b235962.avif?t=1665639629\" width=300 height=80 /></span><br>Along with many items available within the game for players to find in loot chests or crates, there will be items that will be useful in other ways. These seemingly useless items can be taken to a Crafting Altar. Players can then summon potions, weapons or useful items in a random fashion. <br>                                                                         <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1389450/extras/34bb3f55f444c0b3e838ae249c8a4652.avif?t=1665639629\" width=398 height=122 /></span><br><br>                                                                            <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1389450/extras/49d17da35843a47a1e22d8179048b203.avif?t=1665639629\" width=300 height=80 /></span><br>-      Discover the secrets of the new Realm you have woken up in.<br>-\tBattle your way through branching level design. Play side-quests to earn extra loot and XP.<br>-\tDiscover secret portals and areas that take you to new locations.<br>-      Collect items in the game world and use them to craft weapons, potions or items at a Crafting Altar.<br>-\tLearn to master many different spells. Some more powerful than others.<br>-\tColorful, beautiful and vibrant worlds to explore.<br>-\tFind different types of weapons like swords, spears and maces with varying damage. Use them to crush the beasts entering through the Rift.<br>-      Ragdoll physics makes for some fun killing of enemies.<br>-\tGet NPC characters to join you on your quest and help you fight.<br>-       Gain experience and level up from quests and killing enemies to gain more powers and become stronger.<br><br><br>                                                                            <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1389450/extras/65c135baa83c559853d54414dd976caa.avif?t=1665639629\" width=300 height=80 /></span><br>Dark Faction Games is a Solo-Indie game development studio that has been making games since forever! The goal when creating this game was to try and build something solid for players to enjoy, and stay away from things that where too big or technical this time round. I want to learn as much as I can in all areas of game development. The funds and knowledge received from this game, will be used mostly to fund the next project and attempt something much more technical. I hope all of you find some value in this game. I love this game. Thank you for supporting DFG.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Level Complete!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1389450/1f49390309293b7964b3588d0fbcbda107611b5a.jpg"},{"name":"Killer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1389450/cb18d41ccef64ca5d487e8d2bd7d9bcc3720ed7d.jpg"},{"name":"Slayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1389450/37bb3ee05145debbb8c8aa84d12367f298845941.jpg"},{"name":"Deathbringer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1389450/e7f5df8e034e4ed0eb547242a971821a1fc59617.jpg"},{"name":"Samaritan","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1389450/49ab6a5d46ce26ebd0233c55b0a0df65af9d3c1d.jpg"},{"name":"The Death Spirit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1389450/803c3744b3216ead6d4c4cb8d1b2cbeae17fb9d8.jpg"},{"name":"Ground Stomp","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1389450/f0f241d763f53b9dbcd49658827756ca76482ab0.jpg"},{"name":"Lets feast!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1389450/4c3d844242b31c1710f9fa88b096e32f771f8df3.jpg"},{"name":"Undead King","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1389450/16e687348f2b72bd4cc4fe13c8ca0a3ac350fb30.jpg"},{"name":"Army of 1000","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1389450/80540126d17deec7d858a5bb20132ab0f0b52b85.jpg"}],"total":12},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1389450?t=1665639629","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1389450/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1665639629","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1389450/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1665639629","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1389450/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1665639629","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":" The game has somewhat mild violence and gore visible from a distance. Gorey sounds and frightening ambience and ritualistic themes. The game is however intended for most age categories."},"detailed_description":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1389450/extras/e1e19dd7b59d40dc1406f2bbc126b888.avif?t=1665639629\" width=480 height=186 /></span><br>                                                                             <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1389450/extras/5c85947c0045e5134faf6958dbf211a8.avif?t=1665639629\" width=300 height=80 /></span><br>The Spirit is an Action Role-Playing game with elements of old school dungeon crawlers. <br><br>Our protagonist wakes up in a strange world looking for answers. He learns that he has died and returned to the realm as a spirit. The only way he can find his way back to the living is to find the Rift Keeper. He soon learns that the world is being overrun by creatures and demons entering through the Rift. The people of the realm need him, but so does his family.<br><br>One thing that I tried to focus on was to have NPC characters explain or tell little bits of the story. So, even though it is not necessary always for completing a level, the players might find it useful and hopefully interesting to chat to the NPC characters!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1389450/extras/4acbcea4d1614e11f7ab10f8cb88c288.avif?t=1665639629\" width=118 height=118 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1389450/extras/aa57a507918e41e083deeb1fc7c8f461.avif?t=1665639629\" width=118 height=118 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1389450/extras/863dfd66547664b547456b8f36c2cbd0.avif?t=1665639629\" width=118 height=118 /></span><br>Some NPC characters will be able to join you and help you fight your way through hoards of enemies. It will be your task to help heal them. Use TAB to check health and descriptions of enemies. The game features branching dialogue, so if an NPC offers to help you, it is possible to decline his offer.<br><br>                                                                            <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1389450/extras/6d87333400edd1b0b717537ddc667168.avif?t=1665639629\" width=300 height=80 /></span><br>Environments range from mystical forests, dark dungeons, villages, caves and citadels. The goal was to create &quot;pretty&quot;, yet dark and gloomy environments for players to explore. There is even a haunted cemetery with massive hoards of enemies to slash down.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1389450/extras/b6f442632ae44137b8a19e788903ec3c.avif?t=1665639629\" width=488 height=108 /></span><br><br>                                                                            <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1389450/extras/ef43770682ada35ae7b20511e6f4588d.avif?t=1665639629\" width=300 height=80 /></span><br>There are many items in the game that players can collect in various ways. Find useful items in loot chests or crates throughout the levels. Players can also buy from items from merchants. Some items can be used as powerups when equipped in the character inventory. There are also many weapons to find in the game, however, the player can only have 1 weapon at a time. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic